WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Beka ibhodlela elidala eduze kwesitshalo.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Sika ususe ingaphansi lebhodlela. Gcina isivalo.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Bhoboza isivalo sibe nezimbotshana, usibuyisele.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Gqiba umlomo ubheke phansi, unqenqema lusale ngenhla komhlabathi.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Thela amanzi phezulu, aconse ngezimbobo zesivalo esigqitshiwe.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Njengoba amanzi encipha ebhodleleni, umswakama usabalala eduze kwezimpande.
